d fully observed result comparison\",\n      \"confirmed\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"adaptations\": [\n    \"No target behavior changes. MemoryStorage models completed persistence without physical crash recovery.\",\n    \"Unavailable node 3 stops stepping/ticking after commitment; new learner 4 has no instantiated process. Neither is needed for the live majority of either voter set.\",\n    \"Read-only reflection omits logger, traceLogger, tick/step function pointers and MemoryStorage callStats. Role identifies dispatch; no election/random draw occurs within the witnessed stable-leader heartbeat cycle. Driver observation counters are not protocol transition inputs.\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": {\n    \"plan_uncertainties\": [\n      \"State recurrence supports continuation only if the recorded state and excluded fields accurately cover transition inputs; semantic review must check the reflection omissions and source paths.\",\n      \"A nonrecurring result excludes this finite witness only; it does not establish general eventual liveness.\",\n      \"The tested implicit change adds a learner and retains identical incoming/outgoing voter sets; no client outage or changing-voter consequence is measured.\",\n      \"The later user proposal is a recovery diagnostic after the result, not a prerequisite or part of the recurring idle schedule.\"\n    ],\n    \"grounding_unresolved\": [\n      \"A fixed observation must distinguish a recurring closed idle execution from a finite scheduling delay.\"\n    ],\n    \"review_limitations\": []\n  },\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"Direct oracle correspondence is unreviewed\"\n  ],\n  \"boundaries\": [\n    \"An arbitrary numeric tick deadline for general eventual liveness.\",\n    \"Guarantees while quorum is unavailable or caller withholds required storage/application completion.\",\n    \"Safety violations, client-visible outages, or all possible configuration shapes.\",\n    \"Manual JointExplicit transitions.\",\n    \"State recurrence supports continuation only if the recorded state and excluded fields accurately cover transition inputs; semantic review must check the reflection omissions and source paths.\",\n    \"A nonrecurring result excludes this finite witness only; it does not establish general eventual liveness.\",\n    \"The tested implicit change adds a learner and retains identical incoming/outgoing voter sets; no client outage or changing-voter consequence is measured.\",\n    \"The later user proposal is a recovery diagnostic after the result, not a prerequisite or part of the recurring idle schedule.\",\n    \"A fixed observation must distinguish a recurring closed idle execution from a finite scheduling delay.\"\n  ],\n  \"review_ids\": [],\n  \"open_issue_ids\": [],\n  \"correspondence\": null,\n  \"reviewed_complete\": false,\n  \"bounded_complete\": true,\n  \"confirmed\": false,\n  \"outcome\": \"violated\",\n  \"level\": \"implementation_test\",\n  \"claim_id\": \"claim-autoleave-continuation\",\n  \"claim_version\": 1,\n  \"framework_revision\": \"audit-products-v41\",\n  \"finding_ids\": {\n    \"autoleave-cycle\": \"a32288deb59744adb70775d702f7b9a9\"\n  },\n  \"finding_id\": \"a32288deb59744adb70775d702f7b9a9\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
